      "description": "全宽菜单内部的双语导航；这里展示导航列表，原生 dialog 由应用提供。",
      "html": "<nav class=\"ds-nav\" aria-label=\"主要导航\"><button class=\"ds-nav-item\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-nav-title\">Home</span><small class=\"ds-nav-caption\">首页</small></button><button class=\"ds-nav-item\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-nav-title\">Skills</span><small class=\"ds-nav-caption\">技能</small></button></nav>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:15px 32px;max-width:1200px;padding:30px 0 40px;background:var(--surface-solid,#0b1120)}.ds-nav-item{font-family:'Space Grotesk Variable','Noto Sans SC Variable',sans-serif;display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:12px;background:none;border:0;padding:8px 18px 8px 0;color:var(--ink,#f8fafc);text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:opacity .2s,transform .2s}.ds-nav:has(.ds-nav-item:hover) .ds-nav-item:not(:hover){opacity:.3}.ds-nav-item:hover{transform:translateX(6px)}.ds-nav-title{font-family:'Unbounded Variable','Noto Sans SC Variable',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(35px,5vw,72px);letter-spacing:-.04em}.ds-nav-caption{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted,#a4acbc)}.ds-nav-item:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #6ad8ee;outline-offset:5px}@media(max-width:767px){.ds-nav{gap:6px;padding:10px 0 30px}.ds-nav-item{width:100%;padding:10px 0}.ds-nav-title{font-size:34px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav-item{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "经历展开行",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "experience-row",
      "description": "原生展开行、分隔线与圆环箭头；无卡片外壳。",
      "html": "<details class=\"ds-story\"><summary><span>经历 · 示意</span><h3>每一次尝试，都留下一个新的自己。</h3><i><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12\"/></svg></i></summary><p>这里将写下真实经历、变化和收获。</p></details>",
      "css": ".ds-story{background:var(--paper,#e5e9e3);color:var(--paper-ink,#17211e);border-block:1px solid var(--paper-line,#bdc9bf);font-family:'Space Grotesk Variable','Noto Sans SC Variable',sans-serif}.ds-story summary{list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:100px 1fr 44px;gap:20px;padding:30px 0;cursor:pointer;align-items:start}.ds-story summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}.ds-story summary>span{font-size:11px;color:var(--paper-muted,#53605a);padding-top:8px}.ds-story h3{font-size:24px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:550;margin:0;transition:transform .4s}.ds-story i{border:1px solid var(--paper-line,#bdc9bf);border-radius:50%;width:42px;height:42px;display:grid;place-items:center;transition:transform .35s,background .35s,color .35s}.ds-story svg{width:22px;height:22px}.ds-story summary:hover h3{transform:translateX(6px)}.ds-story summary:hover i{background:var(--paper-ink,#17211e);color:var(--paper,#e5e9e3);transform:rotate(45deg)}.ds-story[open] i{transform:rotate(90deg)}.ds-story p{font-size:14px;line-height:2;color:var(--paper-muted,#53605a);padding:0 20px 25px 120px}.ds-story summary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #6ad8ee;outline-offset:5px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "作品预览",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "project-card",
      "description": "直角图面与下方标题；示意内容明确标注。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-project\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"ds-project-art\"><strong>Make.</strong><small>内容示意 · 等待你的作品</small></span><span class=\"ds-project-caption\">从一个想法开始<small>作品 / 示意</small></span><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 18 18 6M6 6h12v12\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-project{position:relative;display:block;border:0;padding:0;background:none;color:var(--paper-ink,#17211e);text-align:left;width:min(100%,420px);font-family:'Space Grotesk Variable','Noto Sans SC Variable',sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-project-art{aspect-ratio:1.28;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:28px;background:#b3c1d1;color:#203332}.ds-project-art strong{font-size:80px;letter-spacing:-.04em;line-height:1;font-weight:500;transition:transform .6s}.ds-project-art small{font-size:10px;margin-top:14px}.ds-project-caption{display:block;font-size:21px;line-height:1.5;padding:22px 36px 0 0}.ds-project-caption small{display:block;font-size:10px;color:var(--paper-muted,#53605a);margin-top:8px}.ds-project>svg{position:absolute;bottom:3px;right:0;width:22px;height:22px;transition:transform .4s}.ds-project:hover strong{transform:translateY(-6px)}.ds-project:hover>svg{transform:translate(3px,-3px)}.ds-project:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #6ad8ee;outline-offset:5px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "阅读筛选",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "filter-selected",
      "description": "选中项以下划线标注；不使用实底标签框。",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-filter\" type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\">全部</button>",
      "css": ".ds-filter{position:relative;border:0;border-radius:0;background:none;color:var(--paper-ink,#17211e);padding:10px 0;font:500 12px 'Space Grotesk Variable','Noto Sans SC Variable',sans-serif;cursor:pointer}.ds-filter:after{content:'';position:absolute;bottom:2px;left:0;width:100%;height:1px;background:currentColor;transform:scaleX(0);transition:transform .3s;transform-origin:left}.ds-filter[aria-pressed=true]:after,.ds-filter:hover:after{transform:scaleX(1)}.ds-filter:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #6ad8ee;outline-offset:5px}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;animation:none!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "信息标签",
      "kind": "chip",
      "refersTo": "tag",
      "description": "弹窗内的只读标签；经历正文中的标签去除背景。",
      "html": "<span class=\"ds-tag\">好奇心</span>",
      "css": ".ds-tag{display:inline-block;background:var(--field,#21252d);color:var(--muted,#a4acbc);padding:5px 10px;border-radius:5px;font:500 11px/1.5 \"Space Grotesk Variable\",\"Noto Sans SC Variable\",sans-serif}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "可触的空间，舒展的故事",
    "overview": "保留 Naresh Khatri 的真实机械键盘与开放画布，将页面分成可触的空间与安静的阅读章节。首页靠字重、比例与留白组织信息；经历和作品以不透明的浅灰绿纸面承接，滚动时形成清楚的前后关系。\n\n最新方向依据用户指定的 Giats、SeamTransitions 和 Lusion 参考：借鉴编辑式留白、连续曲面接缝与短开场的节奏。OPEN SPACE 标记与 SVG 接缝为本项目绘制，未使用这些网站的标志、作品或着色器。",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "真实键帽保留按压、声音与空间姿态，视觉重心不被容器边框打断。",
      "Space Grotesk 的轻重变化承担主显示字，Noto Sans SC 承接中文。",
      "开放深空或日光场景，连接固定浅灰绿的阅读纸面。",
      "首页文字链接、分隔线经历、错列作品组成无卡片外壳的内容层。",
      "同一技能舞台统一进入与退出；静态模式保留等价内容入口。"
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Opaque Chapter Rule",
        "body": "经历和作品共享不透明阅读表面；进入这两个状态时隐藏键盘、猫和场景标签，暂停画布并拒绝场景输入。文字不得依靠透明叠加来解决层级。",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Single Stage Rule",
        "body": "Skills 标题、读数和操作处在同一个 sticky 舞台，随同一退出动画离场。详情只由 HTML 展示，不重新增加与正文竞争的 3D 文案。",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Object Response Rule",
        "body": "真实键帽用独立按压状态响应输入；编辑式链接使用下划线延展与箭头位移，阅读行使用展开状态反馈。每类对象使用适合自身的反馈。",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "**Do** 保留原键盘模型、输入控制与 MIT 署名。",
      "**Do** 让阅读章节以实底遮住场景，并在内容高度变化后刷新滚动触发点。",
      "**Do** 用字重、间距、细线和可见焦点组织主要信息。",
      "**Do** 保留资料示意标签与本地房间说明。",
      "**Do** 同时维护鼠标、触屏、实体键盘和 HTML 目录入口。"
    ],
    "donts": [
      "**Don't** 把首页行动重新包成成排的实底按钮或边框卡片。",
      "**Don't** 让透明但仍可交互的离场内容挡住新章节。",
      "**Don't** 恢复独立固定的技能标题、重复 3D 标签或正文背后的猫动画。",
      "**Don't** 引入第二套平滑滚动引擎或伪造加载百分比。",
      "**Don't** 把参考站品牌、示例技术图标或缺省作品当作用户的个人事实。"
    ]
  }
}
